{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120929","id":3990464343,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7t2adX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120929","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120929.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120929.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120929","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120929/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120929/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120929/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d780feda470f72b07bfaff8bf6bb2ffc47753f84","number":120929,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix incorrect text shader line preview caused by comments","user":{"login":"Linnnnnn42","id":39369724,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MzY5NzI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39369724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42","html_url":"https://github.com/Linnnnnn42","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linnnnnn42/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #120927\r\n\r\nText shader line preview treated comments as shader code during statement and scope analysis. This could:\r\n\r\n- Make a preview use the result of the following assignment.\r\n- Prevent valid assignments from being recognized.\r\n- Make braces or function-like code inside comments affect scope detection.\r\n- Generate wrong preview shaders when using inline or multiline comments.\r\n\r\nAfter files are changed or saved, you always need to manually toggle the shader preview on a row to refresh the display of all shader previews.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR strips line and block comments before analyzing and generating the preview shader by `_strip_comments()`, while preserving line breaks and character positions. Comment markers inside quoted strings are preserved `\"\\\\\"`.\r\n\r\nBrace balancing function `_get_brace_balance()` also ignores braces inside quoted strings `\"{ }\"`.\r\n\r\nIn `_validate_script()`, use the raw code from the text editor rather than the preprocessed code to generate the shader preview.\r\n\r\nTested by:\r\n\r\n- Prek code style checker.\r\n- Building the Windows editor successfully.\r\n- Testing the MRP from #120927.\r\n- Testing trailing `//` comments.\r\n- Testing inline and multiline `/* ... */` comments.\r\n- Testing comments containing braces, parentheses, and function-like code.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/u